    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Puttler is a mini-golf puzzle game featuring wacky obstacles and a charming backstory.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/93a21be00e116506cded2db282f9d1dd.poster.avif?t=1752006830\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/93a21be00e116506cded2db282f9d1dd.webm?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/93a21be00e116506cded2db282f9d1dd.mp4?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/382ef8159b7dbf4154cea93ab943f07d.avif?t=1752006830\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><strong> </strong> <br><strong>The Puttler World Tour has officially begun, and your journey to becoming a professional Puttler starts now! Compete in 14 colorful courses across the globe to build your reputation, earn cash, acquire new Puttlers, and customize your bag. </strong>    <br>\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3a5b72b5e534e1badd5c046b81e22026.poster.avif?t=1752006830\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3a5b72b5e534e1badd5c046b81e22026.webm?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3a5b72b5e534e1badd5c046b81e22026.mp4?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/25eabee85580877d74192521ddce4921.avif?t=1752006830\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><strong>Using physics and seven different shapes called &quot;Puttlers,&quot; your goal is to sink the golf ball in as few strokes as possible! Build creative solutions to stay under par, or craft complex contraptions to solve each puzzle. </strong>     <br> \u00a0 <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/304f29398dc2fbceee997e5e46cec67e.poster.avif?t=1752006830\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/304f29398dc2fbceee997e5e46cec67e.webm?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/304f29398dc2fbceee997e5e46cec67e.mp4?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3127885081dd71beb97b8adc16d71b87.avif?t=1752006830\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><strong>\u27a4 252 satisfying puzzles to solve\u00a0     </strong>  <br><strong>\u27a4 campaign style progression      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 colorful monochromatic graphics     </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 relaxing ambient nature sounds\u00a0       </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 charming backstory and dialogue\u00a0       </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 secret bonus course to unlock</strong>  <br>  <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/ea904fdf02fa1f8f88c7d63950e5ac1e.poster.avif?t=1752006830\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/ea904fdf02fa1f8f88c7d63950e5ac1e.webm?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/ea904fdf02fa1f8f88c7d63950e5ac1e.mp4?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/2d182779f7e413650feb160c6ad178d3.avif?t=1752006830\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><strong>\u27a4 portals\u00a0      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 black holes      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 sand pits           </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 hatches </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 moving platforms      </strong> <br><strong>\u27a4 fountains </strong><br> <br><strong><u>Developer Note</u></strong>  <br>Hey everyone! My name is Anderson, and I'm the creator of <i>Puttler</i>. If you're considering purchasing my game, please keep in mind that we are a very new indie studio of two friends who poured our hearts into this project. While this game isn't a AAA title with endless workshop content, we still estimate over 30 hours of content to 100% the game. <i>Puttler</i> is meant to be a relaxing and fun puzzle game, so if you end up playing, take your time, create fun solutions, and have fun!\ud83e\udd0e</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Puttler is a mini-golf puzzle game featuring wacky obstacles and a charming backstory.</i><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/93a21be00e116506cded2db282f9d1dd.poster.avif?t=1752006830\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/93a21be00e116506cded2db282f9d1dd.webm?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/93a21be00e116506cded2db282f9d1dd.mp4?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/382ef8159b7dbf4154cea93ab943f07d.avif?t=1752006830\" data-has-big width=800 height=66 /></span><strong> </strong> <br><strong>The Puttler World Tour has officially begun, and your journey to becoming a professional Puttler starts now! Compete in 14 colorful courses across the globe to build your reputation, earn cash, acquire new Puttlers, and customize your bag. </strong>    <br>\u00a0 <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3a5b72b5e534e1badd5c046b81e22026.poster.avif?t=1752006830\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3a5b72b5e534e1badd5c046b81e22026.webm?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3198680/extras/3a5b72b5e534e1badd5c046b81e22026.mp4?t=1752006830\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamst